    /// - `- **CUPTI_ERROR_NOT_INITIALIZED** –`: **[`CUptiResult::CUPTI_ERROR_NOT_INITIALIZED`]** –.
    /// - `- **CUPTI_SUCCESS** –`: **[`CUptiResult::CUPTI_SUCCESS`]** –.
    /// - [`CUptiResult::CUPTI_ERROR_INVALID_PARAMETER`]: if `funcTimestamp` is NULL.
